    <h2 class="batch">More components</h2>

    <section><h2>PoolCheckbox, PoolRadioGroup, PoolSelect and PoolSegmented</h2><p>The rest of the form pieces! The checkbox fills with water, the radio floats get an orange center, and a bubble slides along the segments!</p>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="stack"><PoolCheckbox bind:checked={rules}>I read the pool rules</PoolCheckbox>
                <PoolCheckbox checked={allExtras} indeterminate={someExtras} onchange={(v) => { towels = v; goggles = v; }}>All extras</PoolCheckbox>
                <div class="indent stack"><PoolCheckbox bind:checked={towels}>Towel service</PoolCheckbox><PoolCheckbox bind:checked={goggles}>Goggles</PoolCheckbox></div>
                <PoolCheckbox checked disabled>Disabled</PoolCheckbox></div>
            <div class="stack"><PoolRadioGroup label="Lane speed" options={['Slow', 'Medium', 'Fast']} bind:value={speed} row />
                <PoolRadioGroup label="Pool" options={[{ value: 'main', label: 'Main pool', hint: '25 m, 8 lanes' }, { value: 'kids', label: 'Kids pool', hint: 'Warm and shallow' }, { value: 'dive', label: 'Diving pool', hint: 'Closed today', disabled: true }]} bind:value={pool} /></div>
            <div class="stack"><PoolSelect label="Pool" options={[{ value: 'main', label: 'Main pool' }, { value: 'kids', label: 'Kids pool' }, { value: 'dive', label: 'Diving pool' }]} bind:value={pool} placeholder="Pick a pool" hint="Same choice as the floats!" />
                <PoolSegmented options={['Day', 'Week', 'Month']} bind:value={range} label="Range" /><PoolSegmented size="small" options={[{ value: 'c', label: '°C' }, { value: 'f', label: '°F' }]} label="Units" /></div>
        </div>
        <p class="note">{rules ? 'Rules read' : 'Rules not read yet'}, {speed} lane, {pool ? pool + ' pool' : 'no pool picked'}, showing a {range.toLowerCase()}!</p>
        <pre>{CODE.check}</pre></section>

    <section><h2>PoolAlert</h2><p>Banners in calm water, with an orange edge for warnings (they never turn the whole box orange)!</p>
        <div class="stack"><PoolAlert title="Pool closes early">Today at 6, for cleaning!</PoolAlert>
            <PoolAlert tone="success" title="Lane booked!">Lane 4, tomorrow at 7:00.{#snippet actions()}<PoolButton size="small" tone="ghost">Add to calendar</PoolButton>{/snippet}</PoolAlert>
            <PoolAlert tone="warning" title="No running!" dismissible bind:open={alertOpen}>The deck is slippery after the rain.</PoolAlert>
            {#if !alertOpen}<div><PoolButton size="small" tone="ghost" onclick={() => (alertOpen = true)}>Bring the warning back</PoolButton></div>{/if}
            <PoolAlert tone="danger" title="Diving pool closed">The board is being repaired.</PoolAlert></div>
        <pre>{CODE.alert}</pre></section>

